Package: clintrace
Title: Traceability and Lineage Tracking for Clinical Trial Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Shekhar Eranna Chalwadi", email = "skrchalwadicg@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for recording, querying, validating, and reporting data lineage
    and traceability in clinical trial programming workflows (raw to SDTM to
    ADaM to TLF). Supports variable-level and record-level traceability aligned
    with CDISC ADaM expectations (SRCDOM, SRCVAR, SRCSEQ). Designed for use
    alongside pharmaverse packages such as admiral.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
